{"id":"8866f963f5954e34","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/575_Justification_Logic_JD_4.md","title":"575 Justification Logic JD 4","display":"575_Justification_Logic_JD_4","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{575}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{575}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\\)</span>。公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\\)</span>。显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\">\\(!t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\">\\(s+t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\">\\(s\\cdot t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\">\\(t:A\\)</span> 表示相应构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{575}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{575}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}:\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{575}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}:\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项和公式均无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{575}:\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{575}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{575}:\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{575}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜证明变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{575}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{575})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{575},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{575}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{575}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{575})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{575},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{575}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本函数不参与捕获规避，因为本语言无绑定项构造子。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{575}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{575}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{575}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{575}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{575}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>捕获规避重命名恒为恒等操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,575}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,575}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{575}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{575}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{575}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{575}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{575}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{575}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{575}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{575}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{575}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{575}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{575}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{575}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{575}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{575}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{575}=\\{t:\\bot\\to\\bot:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{575}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{575}=\\{t:\\bot\\to\\bot:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{575}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{575}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{575}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{575}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{575}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{575}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{575}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{575}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{575}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{575}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ConstSpec}_{575}\n=\n\\mathcal P\\bigl(\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ConstSpec}_{575}\n=\n\\mathcal P\\bigl(\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{575},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定一个类型化常元规范参数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\in\\mathsf{ConstSpec}_{575},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\in\\mathsf{ConstSpec}_{575},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{575}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{575}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{575}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{575}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由项形成和公式形成子句，常元规范中的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\)</span> 都是合法证明项，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>；公理并集、常元证明行和证据条件均使用这个同一集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{575}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{575}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{575}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{575}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列 5 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{575}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{575}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{575}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,575}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,575}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{575}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{575}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{575}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{575}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-JD4-证书\">8. JD4 证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"575\">\\(575\\)</span>-证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,t,A)\">\\((Q,t,A)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{D,4\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{D,4\\}\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=D\">\\(Q=D\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\bot\\to\\bot\">\\(t:\\bot\\to\\bot\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=4\">\\(Q=4\\)</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\to !t:(t:A)\">\\(t:A\\to !t:(t:A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目同时含 D 公理族与 4 公理族；它不同于只含 D 的 JD，也不同于只含 4 的 J4。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-证据语义载体与后承\">10. 证据语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>原始证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{575}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{575}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{575}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{575}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{575}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{575}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{575}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{575}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{575}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{575}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{575}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{575}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{575}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{575}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{575}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{575}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{575}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证据闭包条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EApp}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EApp}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ESum}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ESum}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECons}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t\\ \\bot\\notin E(w,t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECons}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t\\ \\bot\\notin E(w,t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EBang}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EBang}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECS}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\ (M,w\\models_{575}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECS}_{575}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\ (M,w\\models_{575}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>JD4 证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EviMod}_{575}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECons}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{575}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EviMod}_{575}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECons}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{575}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{575}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{575}^{\\mathsf e}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{575}^{\\mathsf e}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{575}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{575}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{575}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{575}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{575}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{575}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{JD4}_{575}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{575},\\mathsf{PVar}_{575},\\mathsf{PConst}_{575},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{575},\\mathsf{Frm}_{575},\\operatorname{PV}_{575},\\operatorname{TV}_{575},\\operatorname{TVF}_{575},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{575},\\operatorname{freshP}_{575},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575},\\operatorname{SubT}_{575},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575},\\equiv_{\\alpha,575},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{575},\\mathsf{Ax}_{575},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{575},\\mathsf{Proof}_{575},\\vdash_{575},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{575},\\models_{575},\\models_{575}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{JD4}_{575}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{575},\\mathsf{PVar}_{575},\\mathsf{PConst}_{575},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{575},\\mathsf{Frm}_{575},\\operatorname{PV}_{575},\\operatorname{TV}_{575},\\operatorname{TVF}_{575},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{575},\\operatorname{freshP}_{575},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{575},\\operatorname{SubT}_{575},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{575},\\equiv_{\\alpha,575},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{575},\\mathsf{Ax}_{575},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{575},\\mathsf{Proof}_{575},\\vdash_{575},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{575},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{575},\\models_{575},\\models_{575}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统以类型化常元规范 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\">\\(\\mathsf{CS}_{575}\\)</span> 为显式参数，含 JD4 的显式证明项句法、公理、证明对象、可证性、证据模型、一致性语义约束和语义后承；不含可靠性证明或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由符号与替换","text":"3. 自由符号与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-JD4-证书","text":"8. JD4 证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-证据语义载体与后承","text":"10. 证据语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{575}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{575}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{575}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot